#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai guaranteed startup loans"
msgstr "上海市創業担保融資"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:4
msgid "Loan | Citywide / global"
msgstr "融資・ローン | 全市／グローバル"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:6
msgid "Published service; current terms to confirm"
msgstr "サービス公表済み（現行条件の確認要）"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:8

#| msgid ""
#| "`Evidence S105 "
#| "<https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-wisEditor%27spick/20241029/ee56191498d84f059a4d8e43bc2aba3a.html>`_. "
#| "Shanghai's guaranteed start-up loans top 1.3 billion yuan this "
#| "year_Editor's Pick."
msgid ""
"`Evidence S108 "
"<https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-wisEditor%27spick/20241029/ee56191498d84f059a4d8e43bc2aba3a.html>`_. "
"Shanghai's guaranteed start-up loans top 1.3 billion yuan this "
"year_Editor's Pick."
msgstr "`出典 S108 <https://english.shanghai.gov.cn/en-wisEditor%27spick/20241029/ee56191498d84f059a4d8e43bc2aba3a.html>`_. Shanghai's guaranteed start-up loans top 1.3 billion yuan this year_Editor's Pick."

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "金額規模と支援メカニズム"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:13
msgid ""
"Loan ceiling and interest support depend on applicant class and current "
"rules"
msgstr "融資限度額および利子補給（金利優遇）率は、申請区分および現行規定により決定される"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:15
msgid "No equity; repayable"
msgstr "株式の提供不要・返済義務あり"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "申請資格とスケジュール・期限"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:20
msgid ""
"Individual, pre-startup and enterprise routes have different residence, "
"education, registration and employment conditions. Bank underwriting "
"still applies; an interest subsidy does not remove principal repayment."
msgstr "個人向け、創業前段階、法人向けルートごとに、居住証明、学歴、企業登記、雇用創出条件が異なる。銀行の与信審査が必要であり、利子補給があっても元金返済義務は免除されない。"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:22
msgid "Confirm current HRSS service rules"
msgstr "現行の人社局（人力資源・社会保障）サービス規定の確認が必要"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "連絡先と申請方法"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://zzjb.rsj.sh.gov.cn/zzjbdl/jsp/login.html>`_"
msgstr "`公式申請窓口／政策ポータル <https://zzjb.rsj.sh.gov.cn/zzjbdl/jsp/login.html>`_"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "リンク先の主管官庁または運営事業者が連絡窓口となります。本プロファイルでは現行プログラムの直接担当窓口は設定されていません。"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "編集部作成の申請チェックリスト。実際の申請手続きは現行の公式通知または契約書が優先されます。"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:33
msgid ""
"Select the current bank or public guarantee product and check borrower "
"eligibility."
msgstr "利用可能な銀行融資または公的保証商品を選定し、借入適格要件を確認する。"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare accounts, cash-flow forecast, ownership and requested security "
"documents."
msgstr "決算書、資金繰り予想表、株主構成図、および要求される担保・保証書類を準備する。"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:37
msgid ""
"Complete lender and guarantee assessment; compare all costs and repayment "
"terms."
msgstr "金融機関および保証機関による審査を受け、総調達コストと返済条件を総合的に比較する。"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:39
msgid ""
"Sign and track debt service; claim interest support only if independently "
"eligible."
msgstr "融資契約を締結して元利返済を管理する。利子補給（金利優遇補助）は別途資格を満たす場合のみ申請する。"

#: ../../funding/startup-guarantee.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公表されている上限額は助成限度額であり、受給権を保証するものではありません。該当する通知、対象経費の支出期間、他の公的支援の有無、および書面の交付条件を確認してください。"
